Download the AIFI CellTypist model binaries from the Allen Institute Immune
Health Atlas model page and place them here using the filenames listed in
`../INPUT_FILES.md`:

https://apps.allenimmunology.org/aifi/resources/imm-health-atlas/downloads/models/

The downloader does not retrieve these binaries because the current links
redirect through a Google-authenticated Allen service and require interactive
authentication. The binaries are also excluded from redistribution until their
license terms have been confirmed. The files used for this project were
obtained on 2025-06-27.

The optional Immune Health Atlas color table can also be placed in this
directory as `AIFI_L2_imm_health_atlas_type_order_colors.csv`. It supplies
the published AIFI L2 colors in QC and integration reports. When absent,
the reports use deterministic label-based fallback colors; the table is not
required for analysis. Both the model binaries and this table are ignored by
Git. Rebuild the Python image after adding or changing the table; the Make
targets include it in the image tag when present. For direct Python runs,
`PBMC_AIFI_L2_COLORS` can point to a table at a different path.
